#6026
<KEY<MSG
Will you read it?<YNJ0000<MSG<TURThis is Sue.<NOD<CLRI don't believe I ever told
you much about all of us.<NOD<CLRWe came to this island from
the surface on a research trip.<NOD<CLRProf. Booster was on our helicopter,
and so was my mother, my brother,
various assistants...<NOD<CLRThe Doctor as well.
He was there to serve our
medical needs, and did so...<NOD<CLRAt least, until he found
the Demon Crown...<WAI0020<NOD<CLRThat crown, once the property of the
master of this island, grants monstrous
magical powers to its wearer...<NOD<CLRThe Doctor knew this even before coming
to the island, which is why he wormed his
way into our group in the first place.<NOD<CLROnce he had the Crown in his possession,
no one could stand up to him.<NOD<CLRWe had no choice except to
continue our research of the
island under his orders.<NOD<CLRThe Doctor seeks to rule the surface
using this island as a base.<NOD<CLRI think he plans to begin his
assault on the surface by
using the Mimiga as weapons.<NOD<CLRAnyway, I was able to get away somehow,
but I fear the other researchers are
probably...<NOD<CLRNow, he's using the unsuspecting Mimiga
to cultivate more and more red flowers.<NOD<CLROnce he is ready to attack, he will
drive the Mimiga into a murderous
frenzy using the flowers.<NOD<CLRUsing his terrible powers,
he will be able to control the
raging Mimiga to do his bidding.<NOD<CLRAnd that means I, too, will...<NOD<CLRIf you can escape from this prison cell,
look for a hidden safehouse somewhere
within the plantation.<NOD<CLRIf my mother is yet safe, she'll be there,
working on a plan of her own
to stop the Doctor.<NOD<CLRPlease. Help my mother.<NOD<CLRThe password is
"Litagano Motscoud".<NOD<CLR<FL+1024<FRE<MSG
The letter ends here...<WAI9999<END
